flowchart TD
    A[Candidate LLM] --> B{GGUF total <= 12.5 GiB?}
    B -->|no| X[Reject unless explicit override]
    B -->|yes| C{VLM PID gone?}
    C -->|no| Y[Refuse LLM start]
    C -->|yes| D{MemAvailable >= 12,288 MiB?}
    D -->|wait/timeout| Z[Safe fail]
    D -->|yes| E[Start isolated LLM process group]
    E --> F{During-run safety monitor}
    F -->|MemAvailable < 1,536 MiB| G[Terminate current process group]
    F -->|swap > 85%| G
    F -->|temperature >= 82 C| G
    F -->|healthy| H[Continue to completion]
